gall contains material derived from llama.cpp and ggml
(https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp), MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors:

- src/grids.metal: the iq2 and iq3 codebook tables and the sign table.
- src/mv.metal, src/mv.rs: the dequantization formulas of the GGUF weight
  formats (ggml-quants.c, ggml-metal.metal). the mat-vec loops are gall's.
- src/ucat.bin: unicode categories generated from unicode-data.cpp.
- src/model.rs, ops.metal, pf*, dr*, tok.rs, serve.rs: written for gall;
  they implement the model, tokenizer and chat template as llama.cpp
  defines them (src/models/inkling2.cpp and others).
- llama/patches: patches to llama.cpp itself, under its license.

the MIT permission notice in LICENSE applies to that material as well.
